https://github.com/JimGat/CYM-SD-Assets/tree/feature/doom-sd-assets/sdcard

Copy the contents of sdcard/ to the FAT32 SD root. Required: doom/doom1.wad (runtime /sdcard/doom/doom1.wad). License and credits accompany the separate SD assets.␀␀␀Launch refused: %s. Finish that operation, then retry. CYM remains unchanged.␀␀␀W (%lu) %s: REBOOT_REFUSED owner=%s
